VERDICT
========================================================================================================
  G1 works: kappa = 1/2 IS an admissible superfluid coupling (alpha = 0.46 with Lambda = Lambda_DE).  G2 closes the route's premise:
  any self-interaction that thermalises halos thermalised the background earlier (Gamma/H grows into the past), where the gas
  condensed and stays condensed.  G3 then applies the matching logic to the superfluid EOS: the background sound speed is
  relativistic at recombination and 10-200 km/s at z ~ 16-45 for every core the phonons could support.  The dark field cannot
  be MOND in galaxies and CDM on the background with one equation of state.  The door named in the one-sentence answer is shut.

